title: "promptcal-ovd: prompt-conditioned calibration for open-vocabulary detectors"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of phrase-conditioned calibration (PhC) and of the
  experiments measuring how the wording of a text prompt changes the scores,
  the calibration and the risk of an open-vocabulary detector.
